# Export Rules (PDF/Excel)

- Keep PDF and Excel visual semantics aligned with in-app timetable intent.
- Use the same scheduling context source (`buildScheduleContext`) for both formats when possible.
- Preserve category colors, break/lunch/free styles, and lesson accent behavior.
- Ensure exported files are valid (PDF header / XLSX zip integrity) and download-ready.
- Avoid pagination/footer techniques that can introduce blank/black pages in viewers.
- Do not regress teacher/division labeling in lesson cells.
- Keep worksheet and filename generation deterministic and collision-safe.

## Export Verification

- Smoke-test one division and one teacher export for both PDF and Excel.
- Confirm files open in common viewers and data matches generated timetable.

